CHEAP HINT#3

THE OPPONENTS BOTH IN THE ARENA AND WANDERING AROUND THE REALM
ARE GEARED TO YOUR COMBAT SKILLS. SOMETIMES YOU WILL FIGHT
BETTER OR WEAKER OPPONENTS BUT MOSTLY YOU WILL FIGHT EQUAL
OPPONENTS.

HOWEVER, THE CASTLE AND DUNGEONS AND TEMPLES ALL HAVE A SPECIAL
VARIETY OF ENCOUNTERS DEPENDING UPON WHERE YOU ARE. THESE
ENCOUNTERS COULD VERY OFTEN BE MUCH TOO TOUGH FOR YOU TO DEFEAT
AT LOWER LEVELS. 

IN THESE CASES, IT IS BEST TO USE THE SPECIAL "SAVE" FEATURE BEFORE
ENTERING A STRUCTURE. SIMPLY HIT THE "S" KEY. THEN ENTER THE STRUCTURE
AND IF YOU MEET YOUR END...WHEN IT ASKS IF YOU WANT TO SAVE YOUR
PRESENT LOCATION AND STATS THE ANSWER WOULD BE "N".